From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lethalbas <lethalbas@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 20:03:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(win): declare syywrap extern "C" in smcScwin.l

flex 2.6.4 declares 'extern "C" int yywrap(void)' (mapped to syywrap)
before user code, so the C++-linkage definition fails with C2732.
Add the same extern "C" declaration that the Unix variant
smcScan.l already uses. Only the MSVC build uses smcScwin.l.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 SamTFE/Sources/Engine/Ska/smcScwin.l | 4 ++++
 SamTSE/Sources/Engine/Ska/smcScwin.l | 4 ++++
 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/SamTFE/Sources/Engine/Ska/smcScwin.l b/SamTFE/Sources/Engine/Ska/smcScwin.l
index ced0bbeda9449e6e15307a242a3b8cab162a5230..4363479a4dad2119ce6accf43508b4d52b5e0295 100644
--- a/SamTFE/Sources/Engine/Ska/smcScwin.l
+++ b/SamTFE/Sources/Engine/Ska/smcScwin.l
@@ -26,6 +26,10 @@ with this program; if not, write to the Free Software Foundation, Inc.,
 #include <Engine/Templates/DynamicStackArray.cpp>
 extern CTFileName _fnmApplicationPath;
 
+#ifdef __cplusplus
+extern "C" { int syywrap(void); }
+#endif
+
 int syywrap(void)
 {
   // no more buffers
diff --git a/SamTSE/Sources/Engine/Ska/smcScwin.l b/SamTSE/Sources/Engine/Ska/smcScwin.l
index ced0bbeda9449e6e15307a242a3b8cab162a5230..4363479a4dad2119ce6accf43508b4d52b5e0295 100644
--- a/SamTSE/Sources/Engine/Ska/smcScwin.l
+++ b/SamTSE/Sources/Engine/Ska/smcScwin.l
@@ -26,6 +26,10 @@ with this program; if not, write to the Free Software Foundation, Inc.,
 #include <Engine/Templates/DynamicStackArray.cpp>
 extern CTFileName _fnmApplicationPath;
 
+#ifdef __cplusplus
+extern "C" { int syywrap(void); }
+#endif
+
 int syywrap(void)
 {
   // no more buffers
